==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 6 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Pawmot Drop Event]], which ran from April 7 to 17, 2025.

==Trivia==
This is the only card in Pokémon TCG Pocket where the Drop Event promo icon appears on the left side of the art box, instead of the right side.
===Origin===
*{{m|Poison Sting}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Ekans}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

